					<li>Land a win of <span id="spnMultiplier"></span> your bet or more.</li>
					<li>Your multiplier becomes points, rounded to the nearest whole number. A 12.7x win scores 13 points.</li>
					<li>Your bet size decides which leaderboard the points go to:<ul id="ulTierInfo"></ul></li>
					<li>Points keep adding up until the leaderboard ends. The top players on each leaderboard win the prizes.</li>
				</ol>
				<div class="divHowItWorksDetails">
					<div class="divHowItWorksSubheading">What counts as a bet</div>
					<p>The bet amount is the money paid for one spin or one in-game feature buy. A R1 spin is a R1 bet and routes to Standard. A R100 feature buy is a R100 bet and routes to High Roller, even if the slot displays a R1 base stake.</p>
					<div class="divHowItWorksSubheading">Spooky Bonuses: how they work</div>
					<p>Your Spooky Bonus percentage depends on your final leaderboard position. It applies to a qualifying deposit up to the limit for the leaderboard on which you earned the reward:</p>
					<div class="divSpookyBonusTier standard">
						<span>Standard leaderboard:</span> deposits up to R5,000
						<ul>
							<li>20% Spooky Bonus: maximum R1,000 bonus.</li>
							<li>15% Spooky Bonus: maximum R750 bonus.</li>
							<li>10% Spooky Bonus: maximum R500 bonus.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="divSpookyBonusTier elite">
						<span>Elite leaderboard:</span> deposits up to R25,000
						<ul>
							<li>20% Spooky Bonus: maximum R5,000 bonus.</li>
							<li>15% Spooky Bonus: maximum R3,750 bonus.</li>
							<li>10% Spooky Bonus: maximum R2,500 bonus.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="divSpookyBonusTier high_roller">
						<span>High Roller leaderboard:</span> deposits up to R100,000
						<ul>
							<li>20% Spooky Bonus: maximum R20,000 bonus.</li>
							<li>15% Spooky Bonus: maximum R15,000 bonus.</li>
							<li>10% Spooky Bonus: maximum R10,000 bonus.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<p>Smaller qualifying deposits receive the awarded percentage of the amount deposited. Deposits above the applicable limit do not increase the maximum bonus. The percentages shown are separate reward examples and are not added together.</p>
					<div class="divHowItWorksSubheading">Claiming your Spooky Bonus</div>
					<p>After the leaderboard ends and rewards have been allocated, your awarded offers will appear under &ldquo;My Bonuses&rdquo; in your bonus wallet. Select the Spooky Bonus you wish to claim and make your qualifying deposit.</p>
					<p>Your deposit is credited to your real-money wallet. Your Spooky Bonus is credited separately to your bonus wallet and must be activated before you play with it.</p>
					<p>Players may earn rewards on more than one leaderboard. Each awarded Spooky Bonus can be selected and claimed separately, using a separate qualifying deposit.</p>
					<div class="divHowItWorksSubheading">Wagering and winnings</div>
					<p>All cash prizes carry a 1x wagering requirement: the cash prize amount must be wagered once before withdrawal. No cap on winnings applies.</p>
					<p>Spooky Bonuses carry a 1x wagering requirement on the bonus amount only. Once this requirement is completed, the remaining bonus balance, including winnings, transfers to your real-money wallet. No cap on bonus winnings applies.</p>
					<p class="pHowItWorksExample">Example: Deposit R5,000 with a 20% Standard leaderboard Spooky Bonus. R5,000 goes into your real-money wallet and R1,000 goes into your bonus wallet. Activate the bonus and wager R1,000 to complete its wagering requirement. The amount transferred to your real-money wallet depends on your play results.</p>
					<p>The deposit limits and maximum bonus amounts above still apply; &ldquo;no cap&rdquo; refers to winnings, not the amount of bonus awarded.</p>
